msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 100 to all nearby enemies.<br><if ($gn68 == 38)><if ($gn72 >= 66)><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>50% chance of granting <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Threefold Fan Dance</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>30s<br></if></if>Can only be executed while in possession of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Fourfold Feathers</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
