msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 150 to all nearby enemies.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Damage over time<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Potency: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>60<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>15s"
