msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of <if ($gn68 == 19)><if ($gn72 >= 94)>{460}<else><if ($gn68 == 19)><if ($gn72 >= 84)>{400}<else>{360}</if><else>{360}</if></if><else><if ($gn68 == 19)><if ($gn72 >= 84)>{400}<else>{360}</if><else>{360}</if></if>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Restores MP<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Grants <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Supplication Ready</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>30s<br>Can only be executed while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Atonement Ready</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
