msgid "Deals unaspected damage with a potency of 460.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Grants <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Darkside</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, increasing damage dealt by 10%<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>30s<br>Extends <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Darkside</ui-edge-color></ui-color> duration by 30s to a maximum of 60s.<br>Shares a recast timer with <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Flood of Shadow</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
