msgid "Increases <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Kenki Gauge</ui-edge-color></ui-color> by 50.<br><if ($gn68 == 34)><if ($gn72 >= 90)><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Grants <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Ogi Namikiri Ready</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>30s<br></if></if><if ($gn68 == 34)><if ($gn72 >= 96)><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Grants <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Zanshin Ready</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>30s<br></if></if>Can only be executed while in combat."
