msgid "Gradually restores own HP and the HP of all nearby party members.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Cure Potency: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>100<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>21s<br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
