msgid "Gradually restores the HP of all nearby party members.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Cure Potency:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 80<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 21s<br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
