msgid "Afflicts target with <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Sleep</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30s<br>Cancels auto-attack upon execution."
